          "type": "number",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "currency": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:e49f59a4-f55e-4042-8edf-a4cbbce40ce2",
          "type": "string",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "shipping_cents": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:7e522a18-41ed-4bf8-b7ce-d53f4ed29c16",
          "type": "number",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "tax_cents": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:ed05ec25-1ead-4d05-946b-8d8ddcc2466e",
          "type": "number",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "total_cents": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:9610bcb6-0d15-4656-89dc-a14305a12417",
          "type": "number",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "fee_cents": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:93d04388-1faa-4b48-8c4b-2203fad830f5",
          "type": "number",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "refunded_cents": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:79385e39-a2cd-4397-b040-7a3bcc8d6652",
          "type": "number",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "email": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:a40e07c3-488d-440d-936b-502e78efab3c",
          "type": "string",
          "stamped": true
        },
        "status": {
          "$id": "urn:uuid:6cca0545-ca72-432a-b8fd-f557467d3ea3",
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "paid",
            "partially_refunded",
            "refunded",
            "disputed",
            "lost"
          ],
          "stamped": true
        }
      },
      "$comment": "sell.ts, T-34526. Platform's rather than each app's for the reason `product` is: the platform writes it, and a word the platform writes is a word the platform declares — an app that declared its own `order` would have the platform writing into a shape it does not know.\n\n`items` is JSON in one text property, the way `home.first` is; a property is a scalar, and this is a list.\n\nThe webhook writes through the kernel's door (sell.ts `asApp`, T-37881). Who may remove one is graph.ts `FLOORS`."
    },
